  "content": "[Intro]\n[Abm7]\n\n[Verse 1]\n[Abm7]Once was a sweet tiang ba-\nby, we\nheld our love in our hand\nAnd\nnow I reach to\nkiss your lips, the\ntouch don't mean a thing\nAnd that's a cold shot\n\n[Chorus]\n[Dbm7]baby,\nyeah that's a drag.\n[Abm7]\nA cold shot\n[Dbm7]baby,\n[Eb7#9]I let our love go\n\n[Interlude]\n[Abm7]bad\n\n[Verse 2]\n[Abm7]Remember the way that you loved\nme,\ndo anything I say\nAnd\nnow I see you\nout somewhere, you\nwon't give me the time of day\nAnd that's a cold shot\n\n[Chorus]\n[Dbm7]baby,\nyeah that's a drag.\n[Abm7]\nN' that's a\n[Dbm7]cold shot baby,\n[Eb7#9]we've let our love go\n\n[Interlude]\n[Abm7]bad\n\n[Solo]\n[Abm7]\n[Dbm7]\n[Abm7]\n[Eb7#9]\n[Abm7]\n[Dbm7]\n[Abm7]\n[Eb]\n[Abm7]\n\n[Verse 3]\n[Abm7]I really meant I was sor-\nry, [Abm][Bbm]\n[Abm]for ever causin' you pain\n[Abm]  [Bbm]\n[Abm]You showed your 'preci-\nation, [Abm][Bbm]\n[Abm]by walkin' out anyway\nAnd that's a cold shot\n\n[Chorus]\n[Dbm7]baby,\nyeah that's a drag\n[Abm7]\nN' that's a cold shot\n[Dbm7]baby,\n[Eb7#9]we've let our love go\n\n[Outro]\n[Abm7]bad\nSo sad,\ntoo bad\nSo sad\n[Eb7#9]\n[Ab7#9]\nDon't let our true love run cold, babe\n[Abm]",
